<!--
  Runtime vs Config classification for the Regression tab.

  category attribute (required): Runtime | Config | Both
    Runtime  = executes in the running engine (primitives, DI, scheduler, redundancy, comms, historian).
    Config   = configuration/design-time (IDE, editors, GRAccess, deploy, import/export, admin).
    Both     = exercised at both configuration and runtime (e.g. security).

  - The "name" must match the component id shown in the Regression grid (the vobs name in
    docs/impact/component-usecase-map.v1.json), e.g. "AAMxCore", "SysObj", "IDEExtensions".
  - Components not listed here fall back to Unclassified.
  - These are STARTER values inferred from each component's area list — review and adjust to your
    ownership. The file is hot-loaded at app start; edit and restart to re-classify.
-->
